        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>24 Inch Center to Center Square Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modernly designed appliance handle is great for contemporary homes. the sleek shape is ideal for appliances because it is so easy to maintain--a necessity on high-traffic pulls on appliances such as the refrigerator. The Square 24 Inch Appliance Pull is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, or oil rubbed bronze finishes.  It comes packaged with one pull and the mounting hardware to install on any large appliance door panel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-720-aca.jpg?v=1704354747\" width=\"483\" height=\"105\" border=\"0\" alt=\"24 Inch Square Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/24-inch-square-door-pull-sgs-sq2475\"><b>24\" Square Pull</b></a> for metal or wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the 24\" Modern Square Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 24-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Length: 24\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\" Square Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged  mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
